LocalRouter

Early versions of LocalRouter were derived from QuantumNous New API:
https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api
Inspected revision: 918427d8ab41f6adaa4113d0496f1f8621855b70

The current LocalRouter runtime has no source, module, submodule, or runtime
dependency on New API. The independent runtime rewrite was performed after the
upstream source had been inspected and is not represented as clean-room work.
The original project and contributors retain copyright in their work.

CLIProxyAPI was inspected as an architectural reference at revision
f0de1d008fe8881dcb7431cf97b147295874c2b2 and is not included or linked.

